{"text": "# Undertakings, under advisements and refusals\n\n**Court file no.** CV-24-00718834-0000 (Ontario Superior Court of Justice, Toronto)\n**GOLZARI v. STONECUTTER ASSURANCE**\nExamination for discovery of the plaintiff, Shirin Golzari, held 2025-09-18 by video.\nExamined by Dev Raichura (Raichura Baptiste-Cole LLP) for the defendant, Stonecutter Assurance Company of Canada.\nChart prepared by Maeve Teskey, Teskey Injury Law, 410-55 Eglinton Ave. E., Toronto ON M4P 1G8, mteskey@teskeyinjury.example, 416-555-0193. LSO no. 71884K.\nAnswers due November 17, 2025 (60 days; Rule 31.07 of the Rules of Civil Procedure applies to anything not answered).\n\n| # | Q. | Page | U / UA / R | Undertaking | Status as of Nov. 4/25 |\n|---|----|------|-----------|-------------|--------|\n| 1 | 44 | 12 | U | Produce decoded OHIP summary from 1 Jan 2019 to date. Health card 4418 902 337 KP. | Requested Sept 22; not yet received. |\n| 2 | 51 | 14 | U | Clinical notes and records of the family doctor, Dr. Lakshmi Ponnambalam, 2200 Danforth Ave., from 2019. | Received 212 pp. To be served. |\n| 3 | 63 | 17 | U | Complete employment file from Kilbride Logistics Inc., employee no. KL-20771, incl. attendance for 2021-2022. | Kilbride HR says 3 weeks. |\n| 4 | 70 | 19 | UA | Income tax returns and notices of assessment 2020-2023. SIN 546 636 465 to be redacted before service. | 2020-2022 in hand; 2023 T4 missing. |\n| 5 | 88 | 24 | U | Statements for the joint account with her husband, Farhad Golzari, at Humberline Credit Union, transit 20412, inst. 828, acct 4411907, for March 2022 to date. | Client to download. |\n| 6 | 102 | 29 | R | Posts from her running account, @shirin.g.runs, after the date of disability. | Refused: relevance, proportionality. |\n| 7 | 117 | 33 | UA | Whether she has applied for CPP-D and, if so, the decision letter. | Applied 06/02/2023; denied, under reconsideration. |\n| 8 | 131 | 38 | U | Names of all treating psychologists and psychiatrists since 2019. | See note below. |\n\n## Notes for Maeve before we answer\n\n- Date of disability pleaded: 14 February 2022. Policy GH-0044718, certificate 0020771. Monthly benefit claimed $3,412.50; arrears to date about $146,700.\n- Diagnoses in the file: fibromyalgia (2021) and major depressive disorder. She told Mr. Raichura on the record about a hospital admission in December 2022 after an overdose. That admission is NOT in Dr. Ponnambalam's notes; ask Shirin which hospital before we answer no. 8.\n- Shirin's date of birth is 1984-07-30, not 1985 as in the Form 30C. Home: 1806-88 Thorncliffe Park Dr., East York, M4H 1N5. Cell 647 555 0150. She prefers Farsi for anything complicated; Farhad interprets.\n- Our file: TIL-2024-0388.", "kind": "Markdown document", "detail": "467 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Shirin Golzari", "Dev Raichura", "Maeve Teskey", "Lakshmi Ponnambalam", "Farhad Golzari", "Shirin", "Maeve", "Farhad"], "companies": ["STONECUTTER ASSURANCE", "Stonecutter Assurance Company of Canada", "Teskey Injury Law", "Kilbride Logistics Inc.", "Humberline Credit Union"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Ontario", "Toronto", "Eglinton Ave. E.", "Danforth Ave.", "Humberline Credit Union", "East York", "Thorncliffe Park Dr.", "M4H 1N5"], "health": ["disability", "CPP-D", "fibromyalgia", "major depressive disorder", "overdose", "hospital admission"], "sensitive": ["health card"], "names": ["Shirin", "Dev", "Maeve", "Lakshmi", "Farhad", "Raichura"]}, "judged": {"candidates": 0, "requests": 0, "failures": 0, "places": [], "labels": {}}, "chunks": 3, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.20000000298023224, "modelMs": 27841.89999999851, "topicMs": 35855, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "street", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "region", "names", "sensitive_topics"